    Update Hamcrest dep (#6975)
    
    This PR extends #6778 to include a required update to the assembly
    configs. The parent PR does not boot without this change since the newer
    hamcrest build needs the newer caffeine version. A better approach would
    be to have these be packed on their own, but outright removing the line
    in the assembly config omits the library completely, which also doesn't
    work.
    
    If someone has a better way of doing this please let me know, but in the
    meantime this will work.
    
